    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a great start, it really captures the tone I want. Some of the reviewers might push back, though, saying that without active management, invasive species or climate shifts will just destroy these areas. Can you add a part that explains why those 'management' arguments are actually just excuses for sticking to old, ineffective ways of doing things?",
